      "id": "1547128122145509417",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:14:48.57+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Do you do/handle the COB service for wafer.space ? If so, could one order with-COB option now and if it turns out to not fit the standard mezzanine apply something like, say, 1000$ of the add-on option's 1500$ price towards the bill of your customized solution?\n\nIf such isn't possible, it'd apparently obviously be great if at least this add-on option if not also the undiced wafer option can be ordered after the slot purchase and at least up to the purchase deadline. I'm assuming @Tim 'mithro' Ansell 's business plan expects to be able to order extra wafers along with the primary lot if enough customers buy 2000$ undiced wafers, and still ensure it's profitable?\nOr I'd assume a backing/pledge option \"COB add-on, only needed if the slot was purchased bare-dies\" to the crowdsupply campaign would be possible?\n\n(As I just looked at it: why's the crowdsupply deadline more than one full day past the wafer.space website's claimed final clean GDS deadline?)",
      "author": {
